# TheSeoSoul product rules

## Brand & contact
- Brand display: `The` + **Seo** + `Soul` (wordmark via SiteWordmark). Canonical name: `TheSeoSoul`.
- Logo mark: abstract orbit/pulse SVG — never a “TS” / “tS” letter monogram.
- Public contact email: `hello@theseosoul.com` — use this on Contact, Privacy, Terms, About, Footer.

## Audit URL indexing (important)
- Shareable `/audit/[domain]` reports are a product feature; **mass-indexing them is not**.
- Do **not** push thousands of thin templated audit URLs into Google via sitemap or default `index`.
- Default: new/random audit pages should be `noindex,follow` (still shareable for humans).
- Sitemap should only include curated/seed/high-value domains — never a full mirror of every audited domain.
- Never bulk-crawl the web just to grow indexed report pages.

## Positioning
- Free technical SEO + GEO audit with shareable report URLs.
- Honest free tier — no fake traffic/backlink charts.
- Paid traffic/backlinks/SERP later; do not invent those APIs.
